### Smart Loan Tracker API - Messaging Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@authToken = your-firebase-id-token-here
@receiverId = some-receiver-uid
@notificationId = notification-id-here

### Send Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiverId": "{{receiverId}}",
  "content": "Hello, about that loan..."
}

### Get Chat History
GET {{baseUrl}}/messages/{{receiverId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Mark Notification Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
